WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:11.990
When you're attacked directly for the 
second time, you can Special Summon it!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.010
The damage from the first attack 
becomes its attack and defense points.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:43.620
Where am I?  Have I been saved?

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:45.820
What about them?

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:50.830
Yusei…

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:56.590
Yusei, I won't let you leave!

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:03.410
Yusei!

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.010
Yusei!

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:25.650
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:30.750
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:35.660
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:40.430
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:45.790
No matter how bad today is

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:50.770
There's still the faintest light

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:56.180
All I have to do tomorrow

00:01:56.470 --> 00:02:00.240
Is light it myself

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:05.250
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:10.220
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:16.520
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:20.500
Today will never exist again

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:26.400
So I won't stop or vanish

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:56.340
The Destiny Ahead!
Dark King the Ruler of Hell

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.920
That's where you are, Carly.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:43.430
Why did you become a Dark Signer?

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:56.110
Carly, it's me!  If you're here, answer me!

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.230
Carly!

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.710
I was waiting for you, Jack.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:32.450
Is that really you, Carly?

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:38.220
Yes.  In order to meet you, I resurrected 
from the edge of death as a Dark Signer.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:41.910
What do you mean?  What happened to you?

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:46.970
I infiltrated Arcadia Movement, 
and Divine killed me.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.260
What?

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.340
Why?

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:01.080
Because I wanted to get closer to you.

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:05.670
I thought you were sacrificed 
to Earthbound Immortal!

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:09.860
That's why I thought that if 
I defeated the Dark Signers…

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:13.410
That you would be able to get me back?

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:17.700
Are you saying that you can't battle me?

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.000
Stop messing around!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:24.900
If you're going to shoot an arrow at me, 
I'll break that arrow with my own hands!

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:29.370
That's right.  You're a Signer, 
and I'm a Dark Signer.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:32.300
We're bound together by twisted fate.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:46.490
Jack!

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:54.030
The stage is set.  Let's 
being our duel of destiny!

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:00.400
Are you serious, Carly?

00:06:01.030 --> 00:06:03.640
Are you really going to battle me?

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.440
That's…

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.670
It's started.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.080
Master Atlas…

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:19.510
Destiny is ironic, Jack.

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:23.350
In order to chase after you, 
I became a Dark Signer.

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:27.160
But now, you're chasing after me.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:29.030
What are you trying to say?

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:32.570
I'm saying that you can't oppose destiny!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:35.010
Speed World set on!

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:39.010
Hurry up and set Speed World!

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:41.630
Don't order me around!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:44.080
Speed World set on!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:51.300
I know that your duelist instincts 
won't allow you to refuse a duel!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:54.950
Jack, that's why you're the man I chose!

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:59.830
If this is what you want, I 
accept this duel of destiny!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:00.930
Duel!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:07.640
Whoever takes the first corner gets 
to go first!  Try to catch me!

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:11.640
I'll find out what her true 
intentions are in this duel!

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:26.490
I go first!

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:28.190
I draw!

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:30.860
I summon Fortune Lady Light!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:38.320
Fortune Lady's Level increases every turn.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:41.310
On the first turn, Light 
has 200 defense points!

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:51.000
Why was I chosen to be a Dark Signer?

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.780
What am I supposed to do from now on?

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:57.550
Carly.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:01.800
If you want to know the answer, 
then tell your fortune.

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:02.960
Fortune?

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:07.970
That's right.  Tell your fortune 
to learn about your destiny.

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:29.560
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:33.430
Jack, it's your turn.  Bring it on!

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:37.680
My turn!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:42.470
I end my turn.

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:47.440
What?  You're not summoning 
a monster or setting a card?

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:51.810
Oh, you finally decided to accept your fate.

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:56.280
Fine.  I'll use all my 
power to end your life!

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:59.350
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:09.880
I release Fortune Lady Light to 
advance summon Fortune Lady Earth!

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:18.470
When Light leaves the field, I can Special 
Summon one Fortune Lady monster from my deck.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:23.380
Appear, Fortune Lady Earth 
and Fortune Lady Dark!

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:27.660
Earth and Dark's attack points are each 
equal to their Level multiplied by 400!

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:32.380
Earth's Level is six.  Dark's Level is 
five.  That means their attack points are…

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:39.390
2400 and 2000?  If they both attack me 
directly, my life points will be gone!

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:43.110
It will hurt.  Prepare yourself.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.100
Are you serious?

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:48.430
Earth attacks Jack directly!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.670
Cursed Skewer!

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:04.980
Dark attacks you directly!

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.180
Dark Fate!

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.620
Why?

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:22.270
Get better soon, Jack.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:28.440
Carly isn't the type who hurts people.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:34.380
If I took damage from a monster that 
attacked directly, during that turn's Battle Phase...

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:39.450
...I can Special Summon this monster 
if you declare a second direct attack!

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:42.760
Come, Ogre of the Scarlet Sorrow!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:48.600
Ogre of the Scarlet Sorrow's 
attack points are equal

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:51.600
to the amount of damage I 
took from the direct attack!

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:54.400
Next, the second monster that attacked me

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.200
directly will battle Ogre of 
the Scarlet Sorrow instead!

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:11.880
You've decided to fight back, 
but you can't oppose fate.

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:14.850
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:19.320
Now attack me if you can!

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:24.360
Someone must be controlling Carly.  I 
can't think of any other possibility.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:29.340
I'll get you back, even if costs me my life!

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:49.700
The Dark Signers challenged 
the Signers to battle.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.470
It's destiny that they're our enemies.

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:56.910
Who is Jack facing in battle?

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.030
Are you very worried?

00:12:01.510 --> 00:12:06.000
I'm fine.  There's no way 
Master Atlas would lose.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:17.430
But your heart is already somewhere 
that I can never reach.

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:23.690
My turn!

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:30.520
Ogre of the Scarlet Sorrow and Fortune 
Lady Earth have the same attack points.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.260
If nothing changes, they'll 
destroy each other.

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:34.740
In that case...

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:38.500
I summon Power Supplier in defense position!

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:44.640
Due to Power Supplier's effect, Ogre of the 
Scarlet Sorrow gains 400 attack points.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:48.240
I activate the trap Bending Destiny!

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:51.890
It negates your monster's summoning, 
and it returns to your hand!

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:52.810
What?

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:56.960
It's pointless to try anything because 
your destiny is already decided!

00:12:57.590 --> 00:13:01.960
She did more than prevent Ogre of 
the Scarlet Sorrow from powering up.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:05.640
Fortune Lady Earth's attack points 
will increase on Carly's next

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:09.640
turn, so it will have more attack points 
than Ogre of the Scarlet Sorrow.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.980
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:22.860
You're already done?  That 
was boring, but it's fine!

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:26.140
My turn.  I draw!

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:30.890
I'll finish you this turn!

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:32.890
Go ahead and try!

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:38.100
You're just acting tough.  
I'll show no mercy!

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:41.530
Fortune Lady levels up every turn.

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:44.300
Earth becomes Level 7 this turn.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:47.500
Its attack points increase to 2800!

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:51.030
Next, its monster effect activates!

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:56.810
When Fortune Lady levels up, 
you take 400 points of damage!

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:06.390
Earth attacks Ogre of the 
Scarlet Sorrow!  Cursed Skewer!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:24.160
That's not enough to make me give up!

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:29.610
Soon, Jack.  Our true 
destiny will begin soon.

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:35.590
There's no such thing as destiny!  
I'll make you come to your senses!

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:37.930
You're the one who's going 
to come your senses!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:42.270
We're battling in this duel 
so that we can be together.

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:47.560
When the battle is over, 
we'll have eternal destiny.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:50.310
That's what the cards told me!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:56.010
I used my deck to tell the 
fortune of our destiny.

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:57.290
What?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.240
And this is the card I drew!

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:02.670
I flip over my trap card!

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:13.810
Yusei...

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:15.230
Yusei…

00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:17.020
Yusei!

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:20.890
Yusei died!

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:24.070
Be quiet!  He won't die in a place like this!

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:28.440
All he did was fall into that light!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:46.830
Where am I?

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:50.480
Did I die?

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.340
Who are they?

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:04.950
What are you doing?  Stay away!

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:07.540
Stop it!

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.000
Can it be?

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:34.350
They're the spirits of the people who died 
when the old Moment went out-of-control.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:40.080
Their hatred towards me is immense.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:54.400
Jack...  Jack, wake up.

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:59.530
You were moaning.  Did you have a nightmare?

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:03.020
Where am I?

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:06.170
What's this?

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:09.220
Why is there a Dark Signer mark on my arm?

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:12.620
Pull yourself together.  
Are you still dreaming?

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:14.620
Carly, what's going on?

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.400
What happened to me?

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:20.710
What's this?

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:26.090
Don't you remember, Jack?  
You lost your soul.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:49.070
Then I resurrected you with my power.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:53.700
I'm a Dark Signer?

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:04.700
What's this?

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:06.070
Do you remember now?

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:10.330
Thanks to you joining our side, the Dark

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:14.530
Signers won the battle that 
took place every 5000 years.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:43.020
That's right!  I remember everything!

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:47.860
Since the Dark Signers won, the 
world was transformed into hell!

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:51.150
That's right.  And you're the Dark King who

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:54.850
rules this world.  You're 
the supreme ruler of hell!

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:56.360
Dark King…

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:00.550
That's right.  I've come 
to my senses by dying.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:04.320
I don't need friends, bonds or peace!

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:10.290
By ruling this hellish world, I've 
reached the heights of a true king!

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:15.120
Fantastic!  This is the 
world that we desired.

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:27.540
The trap card Enlightenment.

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:31.550
I understood everything 
when I selected this card.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:34.750
Why I became a Dark Signer.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:38.130
What I'm trying to obtain by battling you.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:43.540
It's so that we can reach our perfect future!

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:46.730
I activate Enlightenment's effect!

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:50.970
The monster that destroyed 
your monster can attack again!

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:52.790
Cursed Skewer!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:56.610
Let's go to our future, Jack!

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:59.120
Our future…

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:15.450
Jack, everyone in the world has pledged 
their loyalty to the Dark King.

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:20.110
I see.  It seems there are 
no humans left in this world.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:26.000
This is wrong!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.470
This is not the world that you desire!

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:33.960
I flip over my trap card!

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:37.610
Changing Destiny!  Your 
monster's attack is negated!

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:45.290
Jack, why are you opposing destiny?

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:51.130
If I win this duel, we 
can have a happy future!

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:57.600
That future is a sham!  It's not for us!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:59.930
You're the one who taught me that!

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:24.160
Spirits of the earth, he's 
innocent.  Release him.

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:38.370
Yusei, it's too early for you to come here.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.840
Who are you?

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:02.720
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:07.790
We will build our own future

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:13.230
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:18.400
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:33.540
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.970 --> 00:22:39.110
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:43.820
Even if it loses its light

00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:49.090
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:53.560
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:59.140
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:04.020
This journey has no end

00:23:04.240 --> 00:23:09.480
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:14.720
Hear my voice
